%% Activity diagram: vendor saves an event
flowchart TD
  A([Vendor opens Add New Event or Edit]) --> B[Fill title, category, price, venue, capacity]
  B --> C{One-time or recurring?}
  C -- one-time --> D[Pick date and time]
  C -- recurring --> E[Tick weekdays and time]
  D --> F
  E --> F{Picture chosen?}
  F -- yes --> G[Shrink to 1400 px and encode as base64 JPEG]
  F -- no --> H
  G --> H[Send to server]
  H --> I{Vendor role, capacity 1 to 5000, JPEG under 4 MB?}
  I -- no --> J[Show error] --> B
  I -- yes --> K[Save event and write picture file]
  K --> L{Title changed?}
  L -- yes --> M[Rename event in bookings and tickets]
  L -- no --> N
  M --> N([Event card updated for everyone])
